# Force LF line endings for shell scripts (prevents CRLF breakage in CI)
*.sh text eol=lf

# package.json and the lockfile are rewritten by npm, which preserves whatever line
# endings it finds. One CRLF write (#319) made every later edit look like a full-file
# rewrite — a one-line version bump showed as 55 changed lines, and a real change would
# have been unreviewable inside it. Pin them so the format cannot drift again.
package.json text eol=lf
package-lock.json text eol=lf
